any other problems you mentioned  of course those are the sort of problems  that all governments face and that you  need strong and stable leadership to  deal with and and you have a contrast at  this election that choice with other  people at this election is either the  the strong and stable leadership that  Teresa may provides or Jeremy Corbyn  with a ragbag of other parties that  don't agree with him supporting him  making a coalition of people thank you  very much

